#
# Build-context filter for kingres/packaging/docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).  The context is the repository root or, better,
# a clean snapshot made by kingres/packaging/build/snapshot.sh.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
kingres/web/dist
kingres/docs
kingres/packaging/out
**/*.log
